00:02:37.965 --> 00:02:42.245
customers, says the Samsung agreement would run four to five years from the first half

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:48.385
of 2027, set a minimum supply volume and leave prices to be set later from market conditions.

00:02:49.145 --> 00:02:54.765
Apple recently signed a similar supplier favorable deal with SK Heinix as the memory shortage

00:02:54.765 --> 00:02:58.405
